          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wot a Kaleb me kao, a nyiŋe Meca, ame obedo ominna a Jerameel, rik onywalo Jip, Jip te nywalo Mareca ame obedo papa a Kebron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kebron te nywalo itino awobe aŋwen: Kora, Tappua, Rekem, kede Cema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cema onywalo Rakam ame obedo papa a Jorkeam, Bekem ominna a Cema te nywalo Cammai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cammai ame obedo papa a Maon, Maon ame obedo papa Betjur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
